# Pin the files whose exact served bytes matter to LF, so they are deterministic
# across build environments (CI builds on Linux; contributors may be on Windows
# with core.autocrlf=true). index.html carries an inline script whose SHA-256 is
# pinned in the CSP (public/_headers); a line-ending flip would change that hash
# and break the Content-Security-Policy in production.
index.html      text eol=lf
public/_headers text eol=lf
